Package: imsprog
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Linux chip programmer for CH341A/CH347T/FT232H devices
 IMSProg (I2C, MicroWire and SPI EEPROM/Flash chip Programmer) reads
 from and writes to EEPROM chips in CH341A, CH347T and FT232H devices. 
 IMSProg is free and based on QHexEdit2 and a modified SNANDer programmer.
